@baseUrl = http://localhost:5107

### =========================================================================
### 1. SEMANTIC PRODUCT SEARCH (Phase 2)
### =========================================================================

### 1.1 Semantic Search: Lightweight programming laptops
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search/semantic?query=lightweight%20laptop%20for%20programming&topK=3
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Semantic Search: Wireless noise-cancelling headphones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search/semantic?query=wireless%20headphones%20with%20ANC&topK=3
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 Semantic Search: High-end camera phone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search/semantic?query=phone%20with%20best%20zoom%20camera&topK=3
Accept: application/json


### =========================================================================
### 2. AI SHOPPING AGENT DEMO SUITE (Phases 3 & 4)
### =========================================================================

### 2.1 Product Discovery & Use Case Matching
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I need a laptop with long battery life for traveling and remote work.",
  "topK": 3
}

### 2.2 Natural-Language Search Across Specifications
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Which devices in your store have a 120Hz or higher refresh rate display?",
  "topK": 5
}

### 2.3 Strict Price Requirements (Combined Semantic + Structured Filter)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I have a strict budget of $400 for a smartphone with good battery.",
  "topK": 3
}

### 2.4 Feature-Specific Requirements
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Show me water-resistant smartwatches with GPS for outdoor sports and diving.",
  "topK": 3
}

### 2.5 Product Comparison
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Compare the Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra and the Google Pixel 9 Pro. Which one has better zoom?",
  "topK": 3
}

### 2.6 Multi-Step Similar Product Recommendations
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What are similar alternatives to the Sony WH-1000XM5 headphones?",
  "topK": 3
}

### 2.7 No Matching Products (Budget / Criteria Not Met)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Find me a dedicated gaming laptop under $500.",
  "topK": 3
}

### 2.8 Ambiguous Query (Clarification / Broad Guidance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I want something nice.",
  "topK": 3
}

### 2.9 Questions Unrelated to Store Products
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is the capital of France?",
  "topK": 3
}

### 2.10 Hallucination Prevention (Out-of-Catalog Product)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Do you have the iPhone 16 Pro Max or PlayStation 5 in stock?",
  "topK": 3
}
